{"id": "27bd3ddf-ff02-4fb0-b1fc-989c214df398", "slug": "platform-features-remixed", "title": "Platform Features - Remixed", "description": "Platform Features Testimonial Section is designed for showcasing social proof and customer credibility. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Platform Features - Remixed\"\ndescription: \"Platform Features Testimonial Section is designed for showcasing social proof and customer credibility. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#D97706\"\n  secondary: \"#FAFAFA\"\n  accent: \"#F59E0B\"\n  background: \"#FAFAFA\"\n  surface: \"#E2E8F0\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Newsreader\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Newsreader\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Platform Features - Remixed\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 26; favorites: 2; remixes: 7.\nTags: feature, section, animated.\n## Overview\nPlatform Features Testimonial Section is designed for showcasing social proof and customer credibility. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nDecision Automation Optimize approval workflows. Reduce manual entry and streamline complex evaluations. Identity Verification Financial Audit PASS FAIL Approval Queue Manual Review Finalize Contract Insights Extraction…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Decision Automation; Insights Extraction.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #D97706, secondary #FAFAFA, accent #F59E0B, background #FAFAFA, surface #E2E8F0, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Newsreader for display moments and Newsreader for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Platform Features - Remixed</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:opsz,wght@6..72,400..800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#fafafa] text-slate-900 font-sans antialiased relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 py-20 overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-slate-200 selection:text-slate-900\">\n\n    <!-- Custom ASCII Dither Background -->\n    <div data-ascii-dither-bg aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;bottom:auto;height:100vh;z-index:0;pointer-events:none;overflow:hidden\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Container Lines Directive -->\n    <div class=\"fixed top-0 bottom-0 left-8 w-[1px] bg-slate-200/60 z-0 hidden lg:block pointer-events-none\" style=\"mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, black 10%, black 90%, transparent);\">\n        <div class=\"absolute top-32 -left-[3px] w-[7px] h-[7px] border border-slate-300 bg-[#fafafa]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-32 -left-[3px] w-[7px] h-[7px] border border-slate-300 bg-[#fafafa]\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"fixed top-0 bottom-0 right-8 w-[1px] bg-slate-200/60 z-0 hidden lg:block pointer-events-none\" style=\"mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, black 10%, black 90%, transparent);\">\n        <div class=\"absolute top-32 -left-[3px] w-[7px] h-[7px] border border-slate-300 bg-[#fafafa]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-32 -left-[3px] w-[7px] h-[7px] border border-slate-300 bg-[#fafafa]\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Wrapper with Border Gradient Directive -->\n    <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-[1080px] z-10 p-[1px] rounded-xl\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(226,232,240,1) 0%, rgba(248,250,252,0) 50%, rgba(226,232,240,0.5) 100%);\">\n\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md rounded-xl shadow-[0_2px_20px_-8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] border border-white relative overflow-hidden\">\n\n            <!-- Left Column: Logic Flow -->\n            <div class=\"p-8 md:p-12 relative flex flex-col h-full min-h-[500px]\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-tight mb-3 text-slate-800 gsap-reveal font-['Newsreader',_serif] font-light\">Decision Automation</h2>\n                <p class=\"text-slate-500 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-10 max-w-sm gsap-reveal\">Optimize approval workflows. Reduce manual entry and streamline complex evaluations.</p>\n\n                <!-- Flowchart Container -->\n                <div class=\"relative w-full flex-1 flex flex-col items-center mt-4\">\n                    <!-- WebGL Canvas - Now vastly more vibrant and active -->\n                    <canvas id=\"webgl-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-0\" style=\"opacity: 0.85; mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, black 50%, transparent 90%); mix-blend-mode: multiply;\"></canvas>\n\n                    <!-- Static structural lines -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-[40px] bottom-0 w-[1px] bg-slate-200/80 z-0\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-[160px] left-1/2 -translate-x-[75px] w-[150px] h-[1px] bg-slate-200/80 z-0\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-[160px] left-1/2 -translate-x-[75px] w-[1px] h-[40px] bg-slate-200/80 z-0\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-[160px] left-1/2 translate-x-[75px] w-[1px] h-[40px] bg-slate-200/80 z-0\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-[235px] left-1/2 -translate-x-[75px] w-[150px] h-[1px] bg-slate-200/80 z-0\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Nodes -->\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-6 relative z-10 w-full\">\n\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 border border-slate-200/80 rounded-md p-2 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-sm w-[240px] gsap-node\">\n                            <div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-indigo-100 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-600 text-xs overflow-hidden shrink-0\">\n                                <img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=3\" alt=\"Avatar\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\">\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 tracking-tight\">Identity Verification</span>\n                            <div class=\"ml-auto w-4 h-4 bg-slate-100 rounded flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-check-linear\" class=\"text-slate-400 text-xs\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 border border-slate-200/80 rounded-md p-2 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-sm w-[240px] relative gsap-node\">\n                            <div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-rose-100 flex items-center justify-center text-rose-600 text-xs overflow-hidden shrink-0\">\n                                <img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=12\" alt=\"Avatar\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\">\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 tracking-tight\">Financial Audit</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"flex w-[150px] justify-between absolute top-[148px] z-10 gsap-node\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 text-xs font-medium px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded -translate-x-1/2 scale-90 origin-left\">PASS</div>\n                            <div class=\"bg-slate-100 text-slate-400 text-xs font-medium px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded translate-x-1/2 scale-90 origin-right\">FAIL</div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"flex w-full justify-center gap-8 mt-4\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 border border-emerald-200 rounded-md p-2 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-sm w-[180px] -ml-[25px] gsap-node\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-circle-linear\" class=\"text-emerald-500 text-sm shrink-0\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-800 tracking-tight\">Approval Queue</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 border border-slate-100 rounded-md p-2 bg-white/70 backdrop-blur-xl w-[180px] opacity-60 gsap-node\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:close-circle-linear\" class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm shrink-0\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 tracking-tight uppercase\">Manual Review</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 border border-emerald-600 rounded-md p-2 px-4 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-sm mt-4 gsap-node\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-read-linear\" class=\"text-emerald-600 text-sm shrink-0\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-800 tracking-tight\">Finalize Contract</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Column: Analytics & Visuals -->\n            <div class=\"p-8 md:p-12 relative flex flex-col h-full min-h-[500px] border-t md:border-t-0 md:border-l border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/50 backdrop-blur-sm\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-tight mb-3 text-slate-800 gsap-reveal font-['Newsreader',_serif] font-light\">Insights Extraction</h2>\n                <p class=\"text-slate-500 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-sm gsap-reveal\">Generate comprehensive summaries instantly. Reduce analysis latency significantly.</p>\n\n                <div class=\"font-mono text-xs text-slate-400 mb-6 space-y-1 pl-2 border-l border-slate-200 gsap-reveal\">\n                    <p>&gt; <span class=\"text-slate-500 font-sans\">SELECT</span> dataset_id, <span class=\"text-orange-400 font-sans\">SUM</span>(value)</p>\n                    <p>&gt; <span class=\"text-slate-500 font-sans\">FROM</span> data_lake</p>\n                    <p>&gt; <span class=\"text-slate-500 font-sans\">GROUP BY</span> dataset_id;</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 w-max z-20 relative gsap-reveal\">\n                    <div class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-read-linear\" class=\"text-emerald-600 text-xs scale-75\" style=\"stroke-width: 2;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 tracking-tight\">Query executed!</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Folders Graphic Container -->\n                <div class=\"relative w-full flex-1 mt-10 ml-8 md:ml-12 perspective-[1000px] gsap-folders\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-[-10%] w-[110%] h-[200px] rounded-lg rounded-tr-3xl shadow-sm z-10 transform translate-x-4 -translate-y-4 rotate-[4deg] overflow-hidden\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to bottom right, #f43f5e, #e11d48); box-shadow: -2px 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n                         <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-1/3 h-6 bg-rose-600 rounded-tr-3xl rounded-bl-lg\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-8 right-[-5%] w-[105%] h-[200px] rounded-lg rounded-tr-3xl shadow-md z-20 transform translate-x-2 -translate-y-2 rotate-[2deg] overflow-hidden\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to bottom right, #fb923c, #f97316); box-shadow: -4px 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-[20%] w-1/3 h-6 bg-orange-500 rounded-t-lg\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-16 left-0 w-full h-[180px] rounded-lg rounded-tr-2xl shadow-lg z-30 transform rotate-0 overflow-hidden\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to bottom right, #fbbf24, #f59e0b); box-shadow: -6px 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-[60%] w-[35%] h-6 bg-amber-500 rounded-t-lg\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 top-8 left-4 right-4 bottom-4 border border-amber-500/30 rounded-sm\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(transparent, transparent 19px, rgba(217,119,6,0.15) 19px, rgba(217,119,6,0.15) 20px);\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute left-6 top-0 bottom-0 w-[1px] bg-amber-600/20\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Scripts -->\n    <script src=\"https://api.asc11.com/storage/v1/object/public/published-scripts/exports/20260312094006110-d2b3a7bd-ascii-dither-background.js\"></script>\n    <script>\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        // Stagger Reveals\n        gsap.from(\".gsap-reveal\", {\n            y: 20, opacity: 0, duration: 0.8, stagger: 0.1, ease: \"power3.out\",\n            scrollTrigger: { trigger: \".gsap-reveal\", start: \"top 85%\" }\n        });\n        gsap.from(\".gsap-node\", {\n            y: 15, opacity: 0, scale: 0.95, duration: 0.6, stagger: 0.1, ease: \"back.out(1.2)\",\n            scrollTrigger: { trigger: \".gsap-node\", start: \"top 90%\" }\n        });\n        gsap.from(\".gsap-folders > div\", {\n            y: 40, x: 20, opacity: 0, rotate: 0, duration: 1, stagger: 0.15, ease: \"power4.out\",\n            scrollTrigger: { trigger: \".gsap-folders\", start: \"top 85%\" }\n        });\n\n        // Vibrant Mesh Gradient Shader Setup\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('webgl-canvas');\n        if (canvas && typeof THREE !== 'undefined') {\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, alpha: true, antialias: true });\n            const resize = () => {\n                renderer.setSize(canvas.clientWidth, canvas.clientHeight);\n                renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n            };\n            resize();\n            window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            const camera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-1, 1, 1, -1, 0, 1);\n            const geometry = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(2, 2);\n\n            const material = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n                uniforms: { u_time: { value: 0 } },\n                vertexShader: `\n                    varying vec2 vUv;\n                    void main() { vUv = uv; gl_Position = vec4(position, 1.0); }\n                `,\n                fragmentShader: `\n                    uniform float u_time;\n                    varying vec2 vUv;\n                    void main() {\n                        vec2 p = vUv * 2.0 - 1.0;\n                        float t = u_time * 1.5; // active movement\n\n                        vec2 q = vec2(\n                            sin(p.y * 2.5 + t) + cos(p.x * 2.0 + t * 0.8),\n                            cos(p.x * 3.0 - t * 0.9) + sin(p.y * 1.5 - t * 1.1)\n                        );\n\n                        float f = length(q) + sin(t);\n\n                        // Vibrant color palette\n                        vec3 c1 = vec3(1.0, 0.2, 0.6); // Hot Pink\n                        vec3 c2 = vec3(0.1, 0.6, 1.0); // Bright Blue\n                        vec3 c3 = vec3(0.0, 0.9, 0.7); // Cyan\n                        vec3 c4 = vec3(1.0, 0.7, 0.0); // Golden Orange\n\n                        vec3 color = mix(c1, c2, sin(q.x * 1.5 + t) * 0.5 + 0.5);\n                        color = mix(color, c3, cos(q.y * 1.5 + t * 0.8) * 0.5 + 0.5);\n                        color = mix(color, c4, sin(f * 1.2 + t * 1.2) * 0.5 + 0.5);\n\n                        // Boost vibrancy\n                        color = pow(color, vec3(0.65));\n\n                        gl_FragColor = vec4(color, 1.0);\n                    }\n                `,\n                transparent: true\n            });\n\n            scene.add(new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material));\n\n            const animate = (time) => {\n                material.uniforms.u_time.value = time * 0.001;\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            };\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n        }\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "platform-features-remixed.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/platform-features-remixed.jpg", "source_name": "platform-features-remixed-DESIGN.md", "views": 172, "forks": 10, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T09:06:26.112722+00:00"}